<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese unemployment fell to 7.1 pct in Q3.</title>
<headline>Portuguese unemployment fell to 7.1 pct in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Portugal fell to 7.1 percent in the third quarter, compared with 7.2 in the second quarter, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					Q3 1996   Q2 1996   Q3 1995</p>
<p> Registered unemployed	   324.6     331.0     310.9</p>
<p> Percentage unemployed	   7.1	 7.2	 6.9</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
